# Llamadas de prueba a /api/stock (cambiar branchId y variantId).
### Listado ya contado en una sucursal
GET http://localhost:8080/api/stock/3

### Saldo de una variante (sin fila = nunca se inventarió)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/stock/3/3

### Historial
GET http://localhost:8080/api/stock/3/3/movements

### Recuento (primera vez o ajuste)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/stock/3/1/recount
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "countedQuantity": 12,
  "description": "primer conteo góndola escolar"
}

### Entrada
POST http://localhost:8080/api/stock/1/1/entries
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "quantity": 5,
  "description": "remito proveedor"
}

### Consumo interno
POST http://localhost:8080/api/stock/1/1/internal-consumption
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "quantity": 1,
  "description": "uso en el local"
}

### Extravío
POST http://localhost:8080/api/stock/1/1/losses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "quantity": 1,
  "description": "no aparece en góndola"
}

### Traslado a sucursal 2
POST http://localhost:8080/api/stock/transfers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "variantId": 1,
  "fromBranchId": 1,
  "toBranchId": 2,
  "quantity": 3,
  "description": "pedido sucursal 2"
}
